      {
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#00000000\\,#4D000000)@90|linear(#00000000\\,#59000000)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "srcDot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#7FC4F5|#7FC4F5",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "_note": "身份点(card-design-system §2):直径 5pt、卡名左侧、间距 9pt。天空卡底恒深,故明暗两档同取深色值 #7FC4F5 —— 与卡上白字 #FFFFFF|#FFFFFF 同规。"
      },
      {
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "23pt",
        "y": "12pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-99pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${city},--)] · ${@i18n.card_week_t}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "id": "ttl"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "{parent.w}-54pt",
        "y": "15pt",
        "w": "40pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${at},--)]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#B3FFFFFF|#A6FFFFFF",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "alignmentH": "2"
      },
      {
        "_note": "v45:这一行原来放的是**逐时卡**那句「从 16:00 起有雨 / 12 小时内无雨」—— 一张五日预报卡上写未来 12 小时的事,是错位。改成「五天里最该注意的那一天」,四档由 .df 的 `wkKey` 给。\n⚠️ 日期用 `${wkDate}`(MM-DD)/「今天」,与下面五行列表的行标签**逐字同源** —— 结论指哪一行,用户就得能在列表里找到哪一行;写「周四」他还得自己换算(理由详见 weather.df 的 wkToday 注释)。\n⚠️ `na`(五个预报日没齐)整行不画,不退回「这五天比较平稳」—— 那句话是个**结论**,没数据时说它就是编。",
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${wkKey},drop)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "op",
            "action": "if",
            "props": {
              "val": "$[eq::(${wkToday},1)]"
            },
            "react": [
              {
                "type": "txt",
                "x": "14pt",
                "y": "38pt",
                "w": "{parent.w}-90pt",
                "h": "-1",
                "text": "${@i18n.wk_drop_t}${wkDropD}${@i18n.wk_drop_u}",
                "fontSize": "11.5pt",
                "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
                "maxLines": "1",
                "typeface": "System-Bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "op",
            "action": "if",
            "props": {
              "val": "$[eq::(${wkToday},0)]"
            },
            "react": [
              {
                "type": "txt",
                "x": "14pt",
                "y": "38pt",
                "w": "{parent.w}-90pt",
                "h": "-1",
                "text": "${wkDate}${@i18n.wk_drop_d}${wkDropD}${@i18n.wk_drop_u}",
                "fontSize": "11.5pt",
                "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
                "maxLines": "1",
                "typeface": "System-Bold"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${wkKey},wet)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "op",
            "action": "if",
            "props": {
              "val": "$[eq::(${wkToday},1)]"
            },
            "react": [
              {
