        "type": "txt",
        "x": "{parent.w}-84pt",
        "y": "29pt",
        "w": "70pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${temp},--)]°",
        "fontSize": "26pt",
        "textColor": "#FFFFFF|#FFFFFF",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "alignmentH": "2"
      },
      {
        "_note": "温度条的温标端点必须与行里的数字同一取整口径:`_lo/_hi` 走 parseNumber(…,0)(截成整数),\n而 tmin/tmax 是原始小数(23.2 / 34.2)。混着算 → 最低那天的条从灰轨左端再往外凸 2pt、最高那天够不着右端。\n端点也按同一口径取整后再折算,两端恰好落在灰轨 132 / 260 上。",
        "type": "op",
        "action": "set",
        "props": {
          "key": "_tn",
          "value": "$[parseNumber::(${tmin},0)]"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "set",
        "props": {
          "key": "_tx",
          "value": "$[parseNumber::(${tmax},0)]"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "set",
        "props": {
          "key": "_ts",
          "value": "$[if::(gt::(${_tx},${_tn}),calc::(${_tx}-${_tn}),1)]"
        }
      },
      {
        "_note": "五块行底板恒画在 forEach **之外**(固定 y = 56 + 43k):取数失败时五行结构照样在,\n不会只剩页眉与底部三块 tile、中间一大片空白(card-design-system §5 结构先行)。\n行内内容仍由 forEach 按 `_i - pd` 排到同一组 y 上。",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "56pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
        "h": "40pt",
        "bgColor": "#2EFFFFFF|#1FFFFFFF",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "12pt",
          "leftB": "12pt",
          "rightT": "12pt",
          "rightB": "12pt"
        }
      },
